WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.730
<b><u>Episode 11
</u>What Is Conveyed 
and That Which Remains</b>

00:07.480 --> 00:09.050
That was definitely a woman.

00:09.050 --> 00:11.880
And it's Christmas, too. That poor thing.

00:11.880 --> 00:13.200
H-Hey!

00:22.000 --> 00:23.090
Mama...

00:23.710 --> 00:25.460
Mama! No!

00:25.830 --> 00:27.960
No! No!

00:28.790 --> 00:29.960
Mama...

00:30.820 --> 00:33.750
Mama!

00:36.080 --> 00:38.190
<i>I had regretted it this whole time.</i>

00:41.510 --> 00:45.840
<i>I wasn't very good at conveying 
how I felt with words.</i>

00:46.830 --> 00:53.150
<i>I was scared that something I'd say 
would completely change everything.</i>

00:55.270 --> 00:57.530
<i>I'm sure you felt the same way...</i>

00:59.020 --> 00:59.900
<i>Mama.</i>

01:06.080 --> 01:07.230
<i>Back then...</i>

01:09.070 --> 01:10.530
<i>If I was able to tell you</i>

01:11.990 --> 01:14.460
<i>how I honestly felt...</i>

01:16.810 --> 01:19.670
<i>I carried that regret with 
me this whole time.</i>

01:20.530 --> 01:23.020
<i>So the truth is...</i>

01:23.290 --> 01:24.910
<i>I'm a little happy.</i>

01:26.800 --> 01:27.900
<i>Because...</i>

01:32.430 --> 01:34.650
Now, I can tell you...

01:35.280 --> 01:36.770
how I feel...

01:37.570 --> 01:38.480
Mama!

01:41.760 --> 01:42.870
Pepesha-san...

01:44.920 --> 01:47.280
Pesha, calm down.

01:47.280 --> 01:49.540
You can't do anything.

01:49.540 --> 01:54.090
No. I know that there's 
something only I can do.

01:54.950 --> 01:57.110
<i>The fragment of the memory I saw earlier...</i>

01:57.800 --> 02:01.850
<i>If that was Mama's heart that I saw through 
the power of the Heart-shift bracelets...</i>

02:02.330 --> 02:05.100
<i>I'm sure I'll be able to tell her.</i>

02:05.790 --> 02:07.350
<i>My heart...</i>

02:08.550 --> 02:10.390
<i>My true spirit!</i>

02:14.440 --> 02:17.210
Say, Mama, do you remember...

02:18.290 --> 02:21.550
The promise we made when I was really little?

02:23.230 --> 02:26.450
The wish that I thought 
would never come true...

02:27.310 --> 02:29.570
Now, I'll be able to take your hand.

02:31.420 --> 02:32.330
Stay back!

02:33.880 --> 02:37.100
Promise? I don't know anything about that!

02:37.100 --> 02:39.050
Pesha couldn't say anything!

02:39.680 --> 02:42.350
I'm sure she hated me...

02:42.350 --> 02:45.060
Because I was the source 
of all her misfortune.

02:45.410 --> 02:47.800
We were both just awkward.

02:48.580 --> 02:54.130
We each thought that suppressing our 
emotions would make the other happy.

02:55.370 --> 02:57.980
Say, Mama... tell me.

02:58.670 --> 03:01.180
Tell me how you really feel in your heart.

03:01.180 --> 03:02.950
You still haven't told me.

03:03.450 --> 03:07.200
What kind of child was I to you?

03:08.180 --> 03:11.010
What... are you talking about?

03:11.470 --> 03:14.840
How I really...

03:16.630 --> 03:18.910
<i>Pesha, are you cold?</i>

03:18.910 --> 03:21.020
<i>Well, did you know this?</i>

03:21.020 --> 03:26.220
My... heart... I...

03:27.520 --> 03:31.680
There's a very warm magic spell 
perfect for cold days like this.

03:33.520 --> 03:34.500
Mama...

03:35.530 --> 03:37.610
Surprise!

03:38.070 --> 03:39.820
Nope, nope.

03:40.210 --> 03:41.700
Tzveta-chan...

03:42.020 --> 03:44.780
has Kufufu-san by her side!

03:45.500 --> 03:47.960
Poor wittle Tzveta-chan...

03:47.960 --> 03:51.790
Your heart is aching, and you're so scared.

03:51.790 --> 03:53.500
But it's okay!

03:53.830 --> 03:56.340
Now, remember, Tzveta-chan!

03:56.730 --> 03:59.840
What was your dream again?

04:02.840 --> 04:07.680
That's... right. I...

04:14.710 --> 04:20.480
My life is for all of the 
children of the world...

04:30.100 --> 04:32.290
To create this happy place...

04:32.580 --> 04:35.250
all around the world!

04:36.170 --> 04:38.450
Such immense yet sad power...

04:39.200 --> 04:40.250
Mama...

04:42.710 --> 04:43.940
Pepesha-san.

04:43.940 --> 04:46.840
I'm sure the two of us 
can reach her. Together.

04:47.160 --> 04:51.390
If we combine our powers, 
nothing can overcome us!

04:56.020 --> 04:57.190
You're right.

04:59.040 --> 05:02.090
Even if she's at the bottom of 
an endlessly deep glacier...

05:02.940 --> 05:04.900
...we'll make sure this reaches her!

05:05.940 --> 05:07.680
These feelings!

05:09.720 --> 05:10.700
Tzveta-chan!

05:11.340 --> 05:12.490
It's cold.

05:17.920 --> 05:23.210
<i>My cold, corpse-like body, 
so cold that I've stopped shivering...</i>

05:25.720 --> 05:28.260
<i>So what?! None of that matters!</i>

05:30.680 --> 05:31.730
Tzveta-cha—

05:32.910 --> 05:36.400
<i>I only have one wish.</i>

05:41.550 --> 05:46.150
<i>I just want this freezing world 
gone. That's all I wanted.</i>

05:46.410 --> 05:47.350
Mama!

05:49.390 --> 05:51.110
<i>For who?</i>

05:52.470 --> 05:56.840
<i>There was no one... around me.</i>

05:58.040 --> 06:02.670
<i>I only wished that I wouldn't 
be a burden to anyone.</i>

06:03.210 --> 06:05.420
<i>I don't have anyone...</i>

06:05.860 --> 06:07.490
<i>I don't need anyone.</i>

06:09.030 --> 06:10.230
<i>It's cold.</i>

06:11.960 --> 06:12.810
Now...

06:13.820 --> 06:15.510
you're not cold anymore, right?

06:17.560 --> 06:21.310
<i>Welcome... my precious...</i>

06:23.330 --> 06:24.570
<i>Pesha.</i>

06:38.260 --> 06:39.980
I'm right here.

06:41.700 --> 06:42.980
So please...

06:47.340 --> 06:50.810
See? If we stay together like this...

06:52.460 --> 06:55.350
I'm not cold anymore, Mama.

07:02.650 --> 07:06.900
<i>My Mama was never talkative 
and always cool...</i>

07:07.790 --> 07:10.830
<i>But there were some nights she'd 
laugh cutely, like a child,</i>

07:11.490 --> 07:13.960
<i>and we'd talk with each other.</i>

07:14.630 --> 07:15.740
<i>And when we did...</i>

07:26.950 --> 07:29.590
What are you looking at, Pepesha?

07:31.660 --> 07:33.510
A photo of Lenya, eh?

07:35.800 --> 07:40.100
D-Did Mama not want me anymore?

07:41.010 --> 07:44.670
Is that why Mama died on her own?

07:46.080 --> 07:49.440
Pepesha... What happened 
to Lenya was an accident.

07:50.180 --> 07:53.720
Besides, she loved you very much.

07:53.720 --> 07:57.780
You're lying. She went 
away because she hated me.

08:01.670 --> 08:02.500
Here.

08:06.250 --> 08:08.400
These are letters from Lenya.

08:08.400 --> 08:12.420
She'd actually send me 
letters every now and then.

08:13.270 --> 08:17.110
Lenya never showed her weaknesses to others,

08:17.110 --> 08:21.240
but very rarely, she would 
actually show her emotions.

08:21.240 --> 08:24.690
She probably wrote those letters 
during one of those instances.

08:25.840 --> 08:28.420
Lenya couldn't hold her liquor at all,

08:28.420 --> 08:32.000
so she probably didn't 
remember writing them.

08:32.000 --> 08:34.590
Honestly, she was hopeless.

08:37.480 --> 08:39.700
Pesha, are you cold?

08:40.640 --> 08:43.280
Well, did you know this?

08:43.280 --> 08:47.170
There's a very warm magic spell 
perfect for cold days like this.

08:48.120 --> 08:52.710
See? If we stay together like this, 
we're not cold anymore, Pesha.

08:54.260 --> 08:56.710
Mama, you smell like alcohol.

08:56.710 --> 08:58.850
Huh? You can tell?

08:58.850 --> 09:00.720
Of course I can!

09:03.370 --> 09:04.980
Maybe I had too much to drink.

09:06.040 --> 09:09.230
<i>Yes, exactly. Whenever Mama</i>

09:09.760 --> 09:13.240
<i>drank alcohol, she'd laugh like a child.</i>

09:14.110 --> 09:19.220
<i>We'd play around like friends and 
talk about the silliest things.</i>

09:19.920 --> 09:21.860
<i>And that's why I thought...</i>

09:22.480 --> 09:28.750
<i>that alcohol was a magic medicine that 
allowed adults to return to being children.</i>

09:30.010 --> 09:34.190
Say, Pesha. There's a really lovely place.

09:34.190 --> 09:39.680
You'll never go hungry, 
and it's always nice and warm.

09:40.400 --> 09:42.760
Would you like to go there?

09:43.900 --> 09:46.060
Will you be there with me, Mama?

09:46.060 --> 09:48.910
No, adults can't go there.

09:51.570 --> 09:52.350
Well?

09:54.900 --> 09:55.860
Why?

09:56.960 --> 09:58.990
Because I want to stay with you, Mama.

10:01.760 --> 10:02.790
I see.

10:03.830 --> 10:06.080
I feel the same way.

10:06.840 --> 10:13.340
<i>Pesha. Once you're an adult, 
let's drink together, side by side.</i>

10:13.970 --> 10:19.010
<i>And then, just like today, we can 
laugh like children together.</i>

10:20.270 --> 10:22.980
<i>Let's make sure we promise each other that.</i>

10:23.860 --> 10:30.060
<i>May this world remain dazzling 
until you become an adult.</i>

10:33.890 --> 10:34.980
Mama...

10:37.950 --> 10:39.490
Oh, that's right.

10:40.050 --> 10:42.990
She wrote, "This is my dream."

10:43.510 --> 10:47.790
She hoped that, one day, 
she'd be surrounded by happiness

10:47.790 --> 10:50.760
and be able to laugh with you, 
full of food and love.

10:53.730 --> 10:57.220
You're going to make her 
sad if you don't smile.

10:58.260 --> 11:00.300
But that's... not right...

11:01.370 --> 11:08.370
I'm not smiling here because I'm full of food.

11:08.370 --> 11:10.640
It's because Mama's with me.

11:11.140 --> 11:14.590
I should've told her that it was okay 
if she wasn't very good at it...

11:14.590 --> 11:19.150
I should've told her that I still loved her...

11:28.630 --> 11:30.540
<i>From that day until today,</i>

11:31.500 --> 11:34.010
<i>I never forgot even for a moment...</i>

11:34.830 --> 11:39.050
<i>I never forgot you or the 
love that you gave me.</i>

11:39.920 --> 11:42.550
<i>So that it would reach you 
one day up in heaven,</i>

11:43.460 --> 11:45.890
<i>I tried to spread gentle 
love around the world...</i>

11:47.440 --> 11:50.140
<i>And before I knew it, people 
were calling me a hero.</i>

11:51.280 --> 11:56.230
<i>But the source of my love has 
never changed, not even once.</i>

11:56.230 --> 11:59.690
<i>It was always... you.</i>

12:03.360 --> 12:04.740
Did it reach you?

12:05.460 --> 12:07.030
I really hope it reached you...

12:08.210 --> 12:11.050
Everything that I've wanted 
to tell you for so long.

12:12.770 --> 12:18.000
I'm really bad at this last part...

12:18.790 --> 12:21.460
But please let me say it in my own words...

12:23.320 --> 12:26.110
I love you, Mama.

12:33.650 --> 12:34.560
Shy.

12:36.650 --> 12:39.980
<u>Letana Andreanova
Nickname: Lenya
Nationality: Russian 
 Likes: Children, alcohol
Pepesha's mother.</u>

12:45.430 --> 12:46.740
They got through to me...

12:47.550 --> 12:49.180
Your feelings.

12:50.380 --> 12:51.360
Mama...

12:52.150 --> 12:54.120
I'm sorry, Pesha.

12:54.120 --> 12:56.160
I'm all right now.

12:57.200 --> 12:58.690
The sky...

12:58.690 --> 12:59.290
Ook?

12:59.290 --> 12:59.710
Huh?

13:01.330 --> 13:03.220
Ook, ook!

13:03.480 --> 13:07.090
I know it's a little late, Pesha, 
but there's something I want to tell y—

13:07.090 --> 13:08.390
Tzveta-chan!

13:11.170 --> 13:14.230
It's not over yet! You can't give up!

13:14.230 --> 13:17.390
I can still fight, too!

13:17.390 --> 13:20.270
Kufufu-san, it's okay.

13:21.680 --> 13:23.680
My dream is over.

13:24.300 --> 13:28.650
But at this rate, you're 
gonna disappear, Tzveta-chan!

13:28.650 --> 13:29.410
Huh?

13:30.120 --> 13:31.620
And that's fine.

13:32.260 --> 13:35.580
You should return to him.

13:36.540 --> 13:38.240
Anything else is pointless now.

13:42.000 --> 13:43.550
Okay...

13:43.550 --> 13:46.910
But... I'm not gonna say "bye-bye."

13:56.850 --> 14:00.240
Mama... She just said you 
were going to disappear...

14:02.020 --> 14:05.670
This space is my heart itself.

14:06.400 --> 14:11.070
My current body was created from my heart,

14:11.070 --> 14:14.660
so once this place crumbles, 
my body will also disappear.

14:15.030 --> 14:17.160
No... But why?!

14:17.160 --> 14:20.630
We were finally able to see each other again.

14:22.530 --> 14:27.840
Thanks to you two, I was able 
to awaken from my nightmare.

14:28.580 --> 14:31.330
That's why I want to leave this with you.

14:33.220 --> 14:37.860
The one who created us is the 
child you all call "Stigma."

14:38.710 --> 14:42.900
His power is the power to make 
others' dreams come true.

14:43.360 --> 14:45.320
Make dreams come true?

14:46.000 --> 14:49.820
The things that people wish for 
deep within their hearts...

14:50.390 --> 14:53.580
He has the power to give 
them a form in reality.

14:54.550 --> 14:59.220
It was his power that 
brought us together again.

15:00.490 --> 15:07.230
He took advantage of your 
wish to see your mother again

15:07.230 --> 15:10.390
and created a version 
of me meant to harm you.

15:10.390 --> 15:12.340
But that's...

15:13.030 --> 15:16.070
Does that mean he made 
Pepesha-san's dream come true?

15:16.730 --> 15:18.840
If that's true,

15:18.840 --> 15:23.810
what is Stigma planning to 
do with his infinite power?

15:25.980 --> 15:27.070
He...

15:27.070 --> 15:30.400
strongly wished for a world without adults.

15:30.990 --> 15:33.070
A world for the children...

15:33.760 --> 15:36.680
My wish was similar to that.

15:38.130 --> 15:43.300
But he's unable to make his own 
dreams come true with his powers.

15:44.010 --> 15:47.130
His powers are meaningless when he's alone.

15:47.130 --> 15:50.340
That's why he created friends.

15:51.510 --> 15:54.650
And that's us, Amarariruku.

15:55.600 --> 16:01.100
He gave us all powers rooted 
within our hearts

16:01.650 --> 16:05.380
so that we could fight you 
heroes on equal footing.

16:06.690 --> 16:09.470
That's all I know.

16:09.470 --> 16:12.670
I don't know what he plans to do next,

16:12.670 --> 16:15.950
or what exactly he intends 
to do with the world.

16:16.460 --> 16:21.920
But I do know for a fact that he's 
trying to destroy the current world

16:21.920 --> 16:24.460
as he warps one dream after another.

16:25.440 --> 16:29.710
So please... stop them!

16:30.480 --> 16:33.580
Don't let Stigma destroy this world!

16:35.210 --> 16:37.510
I didn't realize any of it.

16:37.970 --> 16:40.920
Not the fact that he had warped my heart,

16:41.640 --> 16:44.230
nor the fact that if I was
only looking at myself,

16:44.230 --> 16:47.320
I wouldn't be able to 
communicate with anyone else.

16:49.840 --> 16:52.840
You there. What was your name again?

16:52.840 --> 16:55.760
I-It's Teru. Teru Momijiyama.

16:58.750 --> 17:03.340
Teru-san... Your nervousness 
is written all over your face.

17:03.340 --> 17:04.550
But you know...

17:04.550 --> 17:10.420
You have a fiery heart that can overcome 
that, and plenty of kindness, as well.

17:11.140 --> 17:15.800
After all, the fact that I was 
able to bond with Pesha again

17:15.800 --> 17:18.550
is undoubtedly all thanks to you.

17:19.840 --> 17:21.530
Thank you, Teru-san.

17:21.530 --> 17:23.220
Oh, no! I just...

17:24.400 --> 17:26.480
And, Pesha...

17:27.020 --> 17:29.790
I want you to guide her.

17:29.790 --> 17:33.490
Tell the children everything 
that you believe in.

17:34.090 --> 17:40.490
That's the one and only thing 
we adults can do for the future.

17:41.390 --> 17:42.150
Yes.

17:43.800 --> 17:45.880
I believe in you.

17:45.880 --> 17:48.760
I know you two will be 
able to save the world.

17:49.460 --> 17:51.740
I'm counting on you, heroes.

17:53.050 --> 17:53.830
Right!

17:58.250 --> 17:59.090
Mama?!

17:59.370 --> 18:01.670
No... Already?

18:01.670 --> 18:02.730
It's all right.

18:03.350 --> 18:09.550
Even if it was only through Stigma's will, 
I committed one crime after another.

18:09.550 --> 18:12.750
It doesn't change the 
fact that I hurt you two.

18:14.240 --> 18:20.440
But if you'll still call me "Mama" after 
everything you've been through...

18:21.370 --> 18:25.730
Pesha, I have one last wish.

18:25.730 --> 18:26.490
Huh?

18:30.610 --> 18:33.210
It was always a small 
dream of mine to one day

18:33.520 --> 18:39.850
drink alcohol side by side with 
you once you became an adult.

18:48.810 --> 18:50.480
Me, too.

18:50.480 --> 18:51.410
Huh?

18:55.960 --> 18:59.300
Pesha, have you been eating properly?

18:59.300 --> 19:01.690
Huh? Well, yeah.

19:01.690 --> 19:03.680
I'd die if I didn't eat.

19:03.680 --> 19:05.740
I see. That's good.

19:06.400 --> 19:08.680
Try not to get sick, though.

19:08.680 --> 19:10.630
Be extra careful with your liver.

19:10.630 --> 19:12.750
Right... I will.

19:15.300 --> 19:18.240
Now that we're actually talking like this,

19:18.970 --> 19:21.170
it's a bit embarrassing.

19:21.170 --> 19:23.010
I was thinking the exact same thing.

19:24.350 --> 19:26.260
Is it hard being a hero?

19:26.680 --> 19:29.650
Hmm... Well, I guess.

19:30.190 --> 19:34.310
But I think it's really nice 
that I get to save people.

19:34.900 --> 19:37.600
It makes me really happy 
that I can help people out.

19:38.440 --> 19:42.030
I'm pretty sure I got that from you, Mama.

19:42.570 --> 19:43.780
You think so?

19:46.430 --> 19:48.690
Pesha, thank you.

19:48.690 --> 19:50.250
Huh? For what?

19:51.730 --> 19:55.770
Thank you for being born to me.

19:56.900 --> 20:00.010
I'm so proud of you.

20:00.890 --> 20:02.060
Mama...

20:03.460 --> 20:07.120
You're alive right now.

20:07.120 --> 20:11.430
That alone is enough of a reason 
for me to have been alive.

20:11.430 --> 20:16.110
I was finally able to feel like 
my life was worth something.

20:16.940 --> 20:17.640
Yeah...

20:18.590 --> 20:23.630
I wish I could've told you 
all this a long time ago.

20:25.240 --> 20:27.750
But just don't forget this...

20:28.280 --> 20:29.040
What?

20:33.580 --> 20:36.230
I love you very much, Pesha.

20:38.030 --> 20:41.340
I love you more than anything 
else in this world.

20:43.650 --> 20:44.590
Yeah...

20:46.000 --> 20:46.800
Yeah.

20:56.270 --> 20:57.480
I love you, too.

21:05.200 --> 21:06.410
Pepesha-san.

21:07.980 --> 21:09.190
It's so cruel.

21:09.190 --> 21:09.830
Huh?

21:10.500 --> 21:15.120
It doesn't matter how many 
times you go through it...

21:15.770 --> 21:18.960
It's always hard to say 
goodbye to someone you love.

21:19.700 --> 21:25.990
In the end... Letana-san looked really happy.

21:25.990 --> 21:29.720
I'm sure that's because she 
was able to pass her feelings

21:30.670 --> 21:32.970
along to the future.

21:33.630 --> 21:37.470
And that's why we should keep moving 
forward for whatever's next.

21:41.700 --> 21:42.690
You're right.

21:43.300 --> 21:47.190
We can't leave something this sad behind.

21:58.840 --> 22:00.070
Pepesha-san!

22:00.070 --> 22:01.460
Huh? What?
